(#3\) Form Mapping Tables \(v1\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#ACORD 125 Core Mapping \(examples\)) Tj
T*
(- Canonical `legal_name` -> ACORD 125 Applicant Name) Tj
T*
(- `mailing_address` -> Mailing Address block) Tj
T*
(- `naics_code` + `operations_description` -> Business Description / Classification) Tj
T*
(- `years_in_business` -> Yrs in Business) Tj
T*
(- `requested_effective_date` -> Proposed Effective Date) Tj
T*
(- `prior_carrier` / `prior_premium` -> Prior Coverage section) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#ACORD 126 Core Mapping \(examples\)) Tj
T*
(- `lines_requested` includes GL -> enable 126 section) Tj
T*
(- `annual_revenue`, `payroll_total`, `employee_count` -> exposure basis fields) Tj
T*
(- `claims_5yr_*` + claim_detail_items -> Loss History fields) Tj
T*
(- `subcontractor_costs` -> subcontractor exposure fields) Tj
T*
(- `additional_insured_requirements` -> AI/COI section inputs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#ACORD 140 Core Mapping \(examples\)) Tj
T*
(- `location_*` -> Location schedule blocks) Tj
T*
(- `construction_type`, `occupancy_type`, `year_built`, `square_footage` -> property details) Tj
T*
(- `sprinklered`, `fire_alarm`, `burglar_alarm` -> protection details) Tj
T*
(- deductible/limit preferences -> requested terms) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Note: Maintain mapping table as versioned config \(YAML/JSON\), not hardcoded logic.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#4\) Intake Requirements \(Quote-Ready Gate\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Minimum required for Quote Ready:) Tj
T*
(1\) Legal insured name) Tj
T*
(2\) Primary contact + email/phone) Tj
T*
(3\) Operations description + NAICS \(or class code proxy\)) Tj
T*
