T*
(5\) At least one location with address and occupancy/construction basics) Tj
T*
(6\) Requested effective date) Tj
T*
(7\) Prior carrier/premium \(or explicit unknown flag\)) Tj
T*
(8\) Basic 5-year loss summary \(or no-loss attestation\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Gate rule:) Tj
T*
(- If any required field missing -> status remains Engaged, create exception task.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
