(#Confidence Scoring) Tj
T*
(- Start score at 1.0) Tj
T*
(- Deduct for each missing required field) Tj
T*
(- Deduct for contradictory values \(e.g., payroll present, employee count = 0\)) Tj
T*
(- Deduct for low-quality document extraction) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bands:) Tj
T*
(- High: >=0.90 \(fast review\)) Tj
T*
(- Medium: 0.75–0.89 \(standard review\)) Tj
T*
(- Low: <0.75 \(manual rebuild required\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#Validation Rules \(examples\)) Tj
T*
(- FEIN format check) Tj
T*
(- Effective date not in past unless renewal flow) Tj
T*
(- Revenue/payroll non-negative and reasonable ranges) Tj
T*
(- Location addresses valid format) Tj
T*
(- Claims totals align with claim items) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#Review Checklist) Tj
T*
(- Field completeness) Tj
T*
(- Exposure consistency) Tj
T*
(- Coverage intent captured) Tj
T*
(- Loss narrative adequacy) Tj
T*
(- Producer notes added) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
